# A clock that comes in without running (never started, or after a Stop: pulses that are not
# counted) sets the tempo alone: the song played from the panel goes at the clock's tempo from its
# first beat, with no catching up to a bar. Once the clock runs (Start) the beats line up with its bars
sid @SID1@
turn K2 3
wait 1000
clockin 140 1
wait 2000
tap PLAY
wait 4000
expect playing 1
expect follow_speed >4530
expect follow_speed <4620
wait 2000
expect follow_speed >4530
expect follow_speed <4620
midi fa 0 0
wait 4000
expect follow_err <40
midi fc 0 0
wait 500
expect playing 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 1
expect follow_speed >4530
expect follow_speed <4620
wait 2000
expect follow_speed >4530
expect follow_speed <4620
